hram everywhere. Redon marches off in search of the imprisoned priestess, Aderishia, but halfway to the mythic Cave of the Sealed, he learns the impossible - the seals are coming undone! All of Crystania's bad dreams may soon surface: tornadoes, basilisks, Dragon Lords and quite possibly the evil Gods' King, Barbas himself. Will a hard-fought peace be lost so soon?","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Il pozzo dei sigilli","synopsis":"Dopo la liberazione di Crystania una nuova minaccia si fa avanti. L'anello del Caos di Pirotess verrà conteso tra le forze del bene e quelle del male. Shale decide di entrare nel regno del Caos per salvare Ashram. Allo stesso tempo, ma in un altro luogo, Reydon e i suoi compagni sono impegnati a contenere l'avanzata di creature provenienti dal pozzo dei sigilli.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Il Risveglio","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"691","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1150","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1150","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101220","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85312","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"59009","synopsis":"Ashram, desperate to find a home for his people, is tricked into selling his soul. 300 years later, Pirotesse's devotion to her king remains unshaken. In the sacred world of Crystania, amidst a civil war waged by shape-changing warriors, she searches for her beloved Ashram. She meets Redon, a young prince obsessed with avenging his murdered parents…","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Il Risveglio","synopsis":"Ashram, desperate to find a home for his people, is tricked into selling his soul. 300 years later, Pirotesse's devotion to her king remains unshaken. In the sacred world of Crystania, amidst a civil war waged by shape-changing warriors, she searches for her beloved Ashram. She meets Redon, a young prince obsessed with avenging his murdered parents…","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Il risveglio","synopsis":"La campana del risveglio continua a suonare e i sigilli che imprigionavano le entità dannose per Crystania a poco a poco si liberano, incluso Dragon Lord, lo sterminatore degli Dei.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}},{"title":"Teomachia","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"691","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1150","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1150","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101220","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85312","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"59010","synopsis":"This sequel to the Record of Lodoss War OVA series finds Ashram, Pirotesse, and their companions shipwrecked on Beast Island in Crystania. Here, Ashram becomes possessed by a demon and Pirotesse escapes, only to wait in hiding for 300 years before she meets companions brave enough to rescue Ashram from the dark god's clutches and banish darkness from Crystania forever. Among her new comrades is Redon, a prince whose reasons for hunting down the dark forces of Crystania stem from his parents' murder. After 300 years of waiting, will Pirotesse finally free her beloved's soul?","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Teomachia","synopsis":"This sequel to the Record of Lodoss War OVA series finds Ashram, Pirotesse, and their companions shipwrecked on Beast Island in Crystania. Here, Ashram becomes possessed by a demon and Pirotesse escapes, only to wait in hiding for 300 years before she meets companions brave enough to rescue Ashram from the dark god's clutches and banish darkness from Crystania forever. Among her new comrades is Redon, a prince whose reasons for hunting down the dark forces of Crystania stem from his parents' murder. After 300 years of waiting, will Pirotesse finally free her beloved's soul?","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Teomachia","synopsis":"La speranza di fermare Barbass è nelle mani di Reydon e Shale (Pirotess) e nel loro disperato tentativo di risvegliare l'anima di Ashram.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"ita"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1150","mal:1150"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"691","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-3":"1-3"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1150","ranges":{"1-3":"1-3"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1150","ranges":{"1-3":"1-3"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"98034","ranges":{"1-3|-3":"1","1-3":"1|3"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101220","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-3":"1-3"}},{"provider":"tvdb_movie","id":"215583","ranges":{"1-3|-3":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85312","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-3":"1-3"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2NvMpgg8TWFQ6Q7OFiAU0PbXWbY.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt3633660/img"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/85312/clearlogo/612078f2464ee.png"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKmDx4h45JyPx6rVtLwo1DivPuT.jpg"},{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/85312-4.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/b1150-JbF6KW7MdMVZ.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/poster/small/tt3633660/img"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/85312-1.jpg"},{"source":"anilist","url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b1150-JbF6KW7MdMVZ.png"}],"background":[{"sou